{"book":"daxue","id":"sishu.daxue.03","index":3,"passages":[{"editorial_status":"unverified-draft","id":"sishu.daxue.03.01","number":1,"ruby_paragraphs":[[{"modern":"汤","pinyin":"tāng","traditional":"湯","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhī","traditional":"之","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"《"},{"modern":"盘","pinyin":"pán","traditional":"盤","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"铭","pinyin":"míng","traditional":"銘","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"》"},{"pinyin":"yuē","traditional":"曰","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"：“"},{"pinyin":"gǒu","traditional":"苟","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"rì","traditional":"日","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"xīn","traditional":"新","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"rì","traditional":"日","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"rì","traditional":"日","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"xīn","traditional":"新","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"yòu","traditional":"又","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"rì","traditional":"日","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"xīn","traditional":"新","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。”"}]],"translation_indonesian":"Pada tempayan Raja Tang - Thong terukir kalimat, \"Bila suatu hari dapat membaharui diri, perbaharuilah terus tiap hari dan jagalah agar baharu selama-lamanya!\""},{"editorial_status":"unverified-draft","id":"sishu.daxue.03.02","number":2,"ruby_paragraphs":[[{"type":"text","value":"《"},{"pinyin":"kāng","traditional":"康","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"诰","pinyin":"gào","traditional":"誥","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"》"},{"pinyin":"yuē","traditional":"曰","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"：“"},{"pinyin":"zuò","traditional":"作","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"xīn","traditional":"新","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"mín","traditional":"民","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。”"}]],"translation_indonesian":"Di dalam Kanggao (Khong-koo) tertulis, \"Jadilah rakyat yang baharu.\" (Shu Jing - Su King V.9.2)."},{"editorial_status":"unverified-draft","id":"sishu.daxue.03.03","number":3,"ruby_paragraphs":[[{"type":"text","val